WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.600
Cancelling a task

00:00:01.411 --> 00:00:02.401
does not rewind

00:00:02.213 --> 00:00:02.637
it

00:00:03.174 --> 00:00:04.129
In Swift

00:00:04.176 --> 00:00:06.016
cancellation is cooperative

00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:07.737
calling cancel only

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:08.492
signals that the

00:00:08.304 --> 00:00:09.258
work is no

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.060
longer wanted

00:00:10.108 --> 00:00:10.957
and the running

00:00:10.768 --> 00:00:12.383
code must respond

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.254
A cancelled request

00:00:14.066 --> 00:00:15.256
can still finish

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:16.058
and update the

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:16.388
view

00:00:16.577 --> 00:00:17.391
so the last

00:00:17.202 --> 00:00:18.464
response wins even

00:00:18.276 --> 00:00:19.195
when it belongs

00:00:19.007 --> 00:00:19.714
to an older

00:00:19.526 --> 00:00:20.162
search

00:00:20.702 --> 00:00:21.527
The fix is

00:00:21.339 --> 00:00:22.553
to separate resource

00:00:22.365 --> 00:00:23.485
management from result

00:00:23.296 --> 00:00:23.992
ownership

00:00:24.086 --> 00:00:24.864
and to check

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:25.643
what changed while

00:00:25.454 --> 00:00:26.114
you waited

00:00:26.646 --> 00:00:27.660
Full story on

00:00:27.471 --> 00:00:28.367
the dashboard
